<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS4" title='In 5 Discussion and Conclusion ‣ On the Generalizability of "Competition of Mechanisms: Tracing How Language Models Handle Facts and Counterfactuals"' class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5.4 </span>Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
